## Data

`results/*.json` are raw server responses (trimmed to the fields used) collected on the machine described in the
top-level README. `results/chart_*.png` are rendered from those JSON files by the harness in `scripts/`.

## Reproducibility caveats

Single machine, single run per prompt, one GPU (RTX 4080 SUPER, 16 GB, Ada SM89), WSL2, CUDA 13.3. Numbers are
not official benchmarks and should not be compared against the model card's own (H100 / EvalScope) results.
